  m_text: "Star is shared between both players.\nCombos on an enemy show which symbols
    are needed and who must perform them:\n\nExample combos as seen on the right:\nSun
    + Moon \u2014 Player 1 only\nStar + Sun \u2014 Both players, at the same time\nMoon
    + Star \u2014 Player 2 only\n"
